---
description: Repository conventions for agent edits
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` before changing files. Prefer `./gradlew` tasks over ad hoc
commands. Keep edits small, update `docs/` when developer workflows or
dependency pins change, and keep `.context/` as gitignored workspace-local
scratch. Promote durable knowledge into tracked docs instead of committing
`.context/`.
